Airport Fixed Based Operations (FBO) FY 2024 Budget
The Fixed Based Operations (FBO) operates as a separate enterprise center. It is
anticipated that for FY 2024, the FBO would have a total net income of $254,917.

Revenues
The FBO has the following revenue centers: Fuel sales (Skywest, Military, Contract,
Other), FBO services, and miscellaneous revenue.

Due to the runway closure, FBO revenues estimates included a decrease of
approximately 40% for the first three months of the fiscal year. It is anticipated that
revenue will exceed budgeted amounts as they are based on the prior year in which
the runway was only partially open for eight months.

